  "goodToKnow": "Die Echtzeit is real time: in Echtzeit, Echtzeitdaten, Echtzeit-Übersetzung. Deutsche Bahn's DB Navigator app shows trains in Echtzeit, useful given German train delays. Echt means real or genuine (echtes Gold), and colloquially really: Das ist echt gut, and Echt? (really?). It's a calque of English real time. It has no plural."
